    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald Todd bring you this luxurious three bedroom detached residence in one of the most sought after locations in Galway, offering breathtaking Lough Mask Lake views and views of Clonbur surrounding area. Kilbride Point is set on two acres and is beautifully presented throughout, with an exceptional sense of space, light, and modern comfort. The side patio area is a private haven — sheltered, sun filled, and perfect for relaxing or entertaining while taking in the spectacular lake views. The house has beautiful Connemara natural stone finishes. The entrance opens through a solid wooden door into a bright, spacious open hallway with solid oak floors. The door to the left opens into a very well finished living space with its vaulted ceiling, solid oak floors, stove with Connemara natural stone surround, a light filled space with excellent views of the Lake. Additional French doors lead directly onto the private patio, capturing the Lake atmosphere and offering sensational Lake views. Another door takes you into the kitchen dining area all open plan where natural light pours in from multiple directions. The kitchen, with vaulted ceiling, is fitted with white shaker style units and solid oak counter tops. An organised utility room provides excellent storage and functionality. The three large downstairs bedrooms are beautifully finished and include its own en suite, ideal for guests or convenient ground floor living. A convenient WC finishes off the downstairs area. \nAscending the solid oak staircase, you are greeted by an abundance of light and sumptuous space. The first floor opens into a stunning lounge and games room. A further office/storage room is located on this level, along with a beautifully finished family bathroom, completing the luxurious accommodation. The property is superbly positioned within walking distance of the Lake and comes with an optional boat mooring if required. A good sized blocked garage with roller door has great external storage. The location offers excellent connectivity, situated approximately 7 km from Clonbur, 13 km from Cong, and just 50 km from Galway City, providing a direct route to Dublin and onward access to the M4, Shannon Airport and Knock Airport both within easy driving distance. The vast waters of Lough Mask, contain some of Irelands largest brown trout. World Class fishing on your door step. Excellent Energy Rating of B Rating.\nViewings are strictly by appointment only through the sole selling agent Sherry FitzGerald Todd 09326622"
      },
